					<div>
						<p class="text-sm sm:text-base text-base-content/80 mb-3 sm:mb-4">
							Professional development services using cutting-edge technologies.
							I build lightning-fast, mobile-perfect websites and AI-powered
							solutions that help your business grow online. Every project
							includes modern tech stack, optimization, and comprehensive
							support.
						</p>
						<div class="bg-base-300 rounded-lg p-3 sm:p-4 mb-3 sm:mb-4">
